WEBVTT

00:00:44.240 --> 00:00:50.160
On usual, precious nights,
I'd be riding by your side...

00:00:50.160 --> 00:00:56.230
...as you take me in your car for a ride.

00:00:56.230 --> 00:01:01.030
I hung up the phone,
when you called to cancel the date...

00:01:01.030 --> 00:01:08.140
...I tried to pretend that there wasn't a scent of lie.

00:01:08.140 --> 00:01:14.050
The color of my manicure, as it dries...

00:01:14.050 --> 00:01:19.420
...only serves to glamorize this night...

00:01:19.420 --> 00:01:20.020
A-ha-ha...

00:01:20.020 --> 00:01:22.920
The Actress in the Mirror...

00:01:22.920 --> 00:01:25.920
Got to be more straightforward to say it...

00:01:25.920 --> 00:01:30.600
...but uncertainty whispers into my ear...

00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:32.060
'Cause I love you...

00:01:32.060 --> 00:01:34.830
The Actress in the Mirror...

00:01:34.830 --> 00:01:37.800
each time I act, the truth leaves further...

00:01:37.800 --> 00:01:43.110
...and further from my face. You've broken my heart.

00:01:43.110 --> 00:01:43.940
A-HA-HA

00:01:43.940 --> 00:01:46.810
The Actress in the Mirror...

00:01:46.810 --> 00:01:49.780
Got to be able to cry...

00:01:49.780 --> 00:01:54.520
...but my pride keeps revising my dialogue...

00:01:54.520 --> 00:01:55.950
'Cause I love you...

00:01:55.950 --> 00:01:58.890
The Actress in the Mirror...

00:01:58.890 --> 00:02:01.830
There's no turning back now that I've realized...

00:02:01.830 --> 00:02:08.790
...the seriousness of the crime. You've broken my heart.

00:02:19.890 --> 00:02:25.690
Heartbroken Hikaru!
Follow Her to the Winter Beach.

00:02:28.260 --> 00:02:31.800
It all happened sometime
during the final semester of...

00:02:31.800 --> 00:02:33.830
...our last year in junior high.

00:02:38.170 --> 00:02:40.340
You've got to! C'mon!

00:02:40.340 --> 00:02:41.270
What?
You've got to! C'mon!

00:02:41.270 --> 00:02:43.480
Come on, Oniichan! C'mon!
What?

00:02:43.480 --> 00:02:43.610
Come on, Oniichan! C'mon!

00:02:43.610 --> 00:02:45.580
H...Hey, Kazuya!
Come on, Oniichan! C'mon!

00:02:47.150 --> 00:02:48.380
See? Over there!

00:02:48.380 --> 00:02:50.350
What?!
See? Over there!

00:02:50.350 --> 00:02:50.430
See? Over there!

00:02:50.430 --> 00:02:52.860
Say, Oniichan, you wanna rock?

00:02:52.860 --> 00:02:53.790
"Rock?!"

00:02:53.790 --> 00:02:56.720
Yup. Rock!
"Rock?!"

00:02:56.720 --> 00:02:56.800
"Rock?!"

00:02:56.800 --> 00:02:58.900
C'mon, don't you wanna?

00:02:58.900 --> 00:03:01.830
Get real, for goodness sakes!
How could I possibly do that?!

00:03:03.230 --> 00:03:07.270
Really! I can never understand how kids think!

00:03:07.270 --> 00:03:11.410
Besides, I shouldn't even mention that Kazuya's no average kid...

00:03:11.410 --> 00:03:14.080
Aha... A Music Festival, eh?

00:03:14.080 --> 00:03:16.440
So... you applied for it?

00:03:17.180 --> 00:03:18.480
Uh-huh.

00:03:18.480 --> 00:03:21.310
I put Darling down as our leader.
Uh-huh.

00:03:21.310 --> 00:03:21.970
Huh?
I put Darling down as our leader.

00:03:21.970 --> 00:03:22.020
Huh?

00:03:22.020 --> 00:03:25.790
It'll be fine. You can learn to play anything quickly, Darling.

00:03:25.790 --> 00:03:30.730
Hold on! I can't do something like that
without any notice!

00:03:30.730 --> 00:03:34.320
How could you decide on this
without asking me?! No way! Forget it!

00:03:39.670 --> 00:03:42.040
I only thought that we'd...

00:03:42.040 --> 00:03:46.540
I only thought that it would be fun to form a rock band together...

00:03:52.310 --> 00:03:54.210
You've made oneechan sad!

00:03:58.890 --> 00:04:01.120
Come on... Ayukawa...

00:04:06.490 --> 00:04:09.600
Okay... But don't blame me if anything goes wrong!

00:04:09.600 --> 00:04:11.190
Yeah!                     Yeah!

00:04:11.190 --> 00:04:12.410
Darling!

00:04:12.410 --> 00:04:15.740
If we all give it our all, "The Pikkaru's" will get the grand prize for sure!

00:04:15.740 --> 00:04:16.800
"The Pikkaru's?"

00:04:16.800 --> 00:04:17.700
Yup!
"The Pikkaru's?"

00:04:17.700 --> 00:04:17.780
"The Pikkaru's?"

00:04:17.780 --> 00:04:20.700
Our group's name... It comes from Hikaru-oneechan's name!

00:04:21.610 --> 00:04:25.340
The Pikkaru's "brightly shine," you see... Right!
"Hikaru:" to shine."Pikkari:" brightly.

00:04:25.340 --> 00:04:25.390
"Hikaru:" to shine."Pikkari:" brightly.

00:04:25.390 --> 00:04:28.240
Now that's funny!

00:05:54.170 --> 00:05:55.690
Yukari...

00:06:14.550 --> 00:06:17.580
Guys... Sorry... but could we take five?

00:06:38.810 --> 00:06:40.360
Hey! Kazuya!

00:06:40.360 --> 00:06:42.220
Shh! It'll be fine!

00:06:42.220 --> 00:06:45.010
Be serious! Would you knock it off?!

00:06:59.230 --> 00:07:02.100
"Elation"

00:07:12.550 --> 00:07:14.490
It's gotten late, huh?

00:07:14.490 --> 00:07:17.550
Couldn't help it...
We just started, after all...

00:07:19.220 --> 00:07:21.700
Can't get it off your mind, can you...?

00:07:21.700 --> 00:07:24.880
They're adults.
I'm sure they'll make up soon.

00:07:25.630 --> 00:07:28.220
Huh...? Oh...

00:07:29.960 --> 00:07:33.920
What's more important is...
to put our all into The Pikkaru's!

00:07:36.500 --> 00:07:41.460
Oh, yeah! Shuu was saying...
that he'd write some songs for us.

00:07:49.680 --> 00:07:50.720
Thank you.

00:07:50.720 --> 00:07:53.240
Yeah... Well, then... See you tomorrow.
Thank you.

00:07:53.240 --> 00:07:53.320
Thank you.

00:07:53.320 --> 00:07:55.930
Since tomorrow's Saturday, can you come early?

00:07:55.930 --> 00:07:58.830
Oh! Tomorrow's Saturday, huh?

00:07:58.830 --> 00:08:00.030
Well, take care!

00:08:00.030 --> 00:08:01.720
See ya.
Well, take care!

00:08:23.450 --> 00:08:25.420
Sorry...

00:08:27.620 --> 00:08:29.520
Sure...

00:08:41.100 --> 00:08:43.260
H...Hi... Good evening.

00:08:53.050 --> 00:08:54.920
What?! What was that?!

00:08:54.920 --> 00:08:56.860
"The P...Pikkaru's..."

00:08:56.860 --> 00:09:00.000
Gosh... Sounds like
a little league team, huh?

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:02.030
Uh-huh...

00:09:02.030 --> 00:09:03.020
Have some.

00:09:03.020 --> 00:09:06.980
Oh! No! I'm only in junior high, so...
Have some.

00:09:08.930 --> 00:09:11.900
Well, then... maybe just a sip...

00:09:17.570 --> 00:09:19.810
What happened after that was...

00:09:19.810 --> 00:09:25.940
...that I watched TV with Yukari,
all night long.

00:10:07.550 --> 00:10:09.850
O... Oh, shoot!

00:11:14.590 --> 00:11:17.280
I...I...I was just, er...

00:11:17.720 --> 00:11:19.690
If you'll excuse me!

00:11:39.010 --> 00:11:41.210
Coming home in the morning, eh? You stud!

00:11:42.120 --> 00:11:44.360
What were you doing, out all night long?!

00:11:44.360 --> 00:11:46.420
Wh... N...No...

00:11:47.690 --> 00:11:49.660
In short, I...

00:11:55.900 --> 00:11:59.230
"Believe Me"

00:12:23.130 --> 00:12:25.150
"H...Hikaru..."

00:12:26.430 --> 00:12:29.260
"Darling... Where were you last night?"

00:12:30.500 --> 00:12:33.750
"I was worried about you.

00:12:33.750 --> 00:12:36.770
"Madoka said that you guys split around 10 PM...

00:12:38.540 --> 00:12:40.390
"What were you really doing?"

00:12:40.390 --> 00:12:42.110
"Something naughty with Madoka...?"

00:12:42.110 --> 00:12:43.080
"D...Dummy!
"Something naughty with Madoka...?"

00:12:43.080 --> 00:12:43.160
"Something naughty with Madoka...?"

00:12:43.160 --> 00:12:45.220
"I wasn't doing anything with anybody!"

00:12:45.220 --> 00:12:47.320
"I was just...

00:12:47.320 --> 00:12:48.830
"...just...

00:12:48.830 --> 00:12:50.850
"...I was...

00:12:54.330 --> 00:12:57.620
"...practicing the drums all night long...
trying to get better at it."

00:13:01.800 --> 00:13:04.210
"Darling...

00:13:04.210 --> 00:13:06.480
"I thought that was it!

00:13:06.480 --> 00:13:10.200
"You really want us to win at
the Music Festival, isn't that so, Darling?"

00:13:16.080 --> 00:13:19.050
"I dreamt about it all along..."

00:13:37.600 --> 00:13:39.410
"Bet it must be so nice...

00:13:39.410 --> 00:13:42.440
"...to be listening to you play, caressed by the sea breeze."

00:13:48.410 --> 00:13:50.380
Oniichan...

00:13:53.990 --> 00:13:56.950
Is there anything wrong, Darling?

00:13:59.960 --> 00:14:01.290
Kazuya!

00:14:02.860 --> 00:14:04.840
Did something happen... to Oniichan?

00:14:04.840 --> 00:14:09.390
Huh? Er, no... I was, er, just standing here, so...

00:14:14.070 --> 00:14:15.270
Kazuya!

00:14:15.270 --> 00:14:15.900
Huh?
Kazuya!

00:14:18.480 --> 00:14:19.840
Er...

00:14:19.840 --> 00:14:21.810
You know something, don't you?
Er...

00:14:37.160 --> 00:14:40.200
That can't be... That can't possibly be true!

00:14:40.200 --> 00:14:42.430
Darling wouldn't do such a thing.

00:14:43.530 --> 00:14:46.590
It can't be... It can't be...

00:14:48.740 --> 00:14:50.710
It can't possibly be true!

00:14:54.280 --> 00:14:56.090
Hikaru...

00:14:56.090 --> 00:14:57.440
Darling...

00:15:03.020 --> 00:15:06.580
Sempai... you weren't
with Yukari last night, right?

00:15:09.260 --> 00:15:12.230
Well? It's not true, right?

00:15:17.940 --> 00:15:19.680
T...

00:15:19.680 --> 00:15:21.330
The truth is that...

00:15:24.640 --> 00:15:28.750
Hikaru!

00:15:32.280 --> 00:15:35.250
Darling... Darling...

00:15:37.690 --> 00:15:39.760
I hate you!

00:15:39.760 --> 00:15:41.830
Hikaru...

00:16:20.160 --> 00:16:22.000
"Orange Noise"

00:16:22.000 --> 00:16:24.240
Oniichan...
"Orange Noise"

00:16:24.240 --> 00:16:24.370
"Orange Noise"

00:16:24.370 --> 00:16:27.430
The truth is, something did happen, right?
"Orange Noise"

00:16:29.110 --> 00:16:30.850
Why did you have to lie?

00:16:30.850 --> 00:16:33.910
Will you shut up? Don't make me
say it again and again!

00:16:35.880 --> 00:16:37.870
I wanna do the "coming home in the morning" thing too!

00:16:44.920 --> 00:16:46.890
Kasuga!

00:17:00.540 --> 00:17:03.440
Just what did you do to Hikaru?!

00:17:04.140 --> 00:17:05.210
You bastard!

00:17:05.210 --> 00:17:07.180
That's enough!
You bastard!

00:17:09.180 --> 00:17:11.320
He said nothing happened...

00:17:11.320 --> 00:17:13.350
...why can't we leave it at that?!

00:17:14.790 --> 00:17:17.130
You've all lost your minds!

00:17:17.130 --> 00:17:19.660
Let go of me.

00:17:20.960 --> 00:17:23.560
I'll go look for Hikaru!

00:17:23.560 --> 00:17:25.500
I...I'll go look for her too!

00:17:25.500 --> 00:17:27.560
M...Me too!

00:17:33.910 --> 00:17:36.050
Why has this gotten so out of control?

00:17:36.050 --> 00:17:39.080
Nothing's changed since yesterday.

00:17:40.310 --> 00:17:43.470
Forming a band was
a bad idea from the beginning.

00:17:47.790 --> 00:17:49.760
If nothing happened...

00:17:49.760 --> 00:17:52.410
...if nothing happened...
why did you have to lie?!

00:17:56.530 --> 00:18:00.160
I ran into Yukari...
at the train station this morning.

00:18:00.930 --> 00:18:03.270
"Thanks for last night..."

00:18:03.270 --> 00:18:06.410
She said, "Tell Kasuga I said so."

00:18:06.410 --> 00:18:08.440
Shuu was with her too.

00:18:10.140 --> 00:18:12.650
I had a feeling that she knew...

00:18:12.650 --> 00:18:15.680
...but, as it turns out...
I'm playing the fool.

00:18:16.310 --> 00:18:18.750
What a joke!

00:18:21.650 --> 00:18:23.550
Oh... What's wrong, Kazuya?

00:18:25.860 --> 00:18:30.150
Hikaru-oneechan is...

00:18:31.730 --> 00:18:33.470
Oniichan, it's terrible...

00:18:33.470 --> 00:18:36.170
And? Where is Hikaru?

00:18:36.170 --> 00:18:38.240
B... By the sea...

00:18:40.100 --> 00:18:43.070
She's by the sea, where the Festival will be!

00:18:57.620 --> 00:19:00.590
O...Oniichan!

00:20:00.150 --> 00:20:02.920
"If nothing happened...
why did you have to lie?!"

00:20:08.690 --> 00:20:10.490
Hikaru!

00:22:05.740 --> 00:22:08.540
How did you know that I'd be here?

00:22:09.250 --> 00:22:13.260
Here... in a week, the Festival will take place, right?

00:22:13.260 --> 00:22:16.580
Sempai... The truth is that you were practicing, isn't it?

00:22:17.590 --> 00:22:21.920
I'm sorry... 'Til just a second ago,
I could only hate you...

00:22:22.660 --> 00:22:24.670
But I heard the sound...

00:22:24.670 --> 00:22:26.340
...the sound of drums.

00:22:26.340 --> 00:22:29.440
And then when I saw your face...
somehow I...

00:22:29.440 --> 00:22:32.580
I'll do it, after all... Right here!

00:22:32.580 --> 00:22:34.670
Oh! Madoka!

00:22:47.150 --> 00:22:51.880
Maybe because I... wasn't straightforward...

00:22:55.190 --> 00:22:59.210
Oh... I wish the Festival would start soon!

00:22:59.210 --> 00:23:02.270
Hikaru... are you really all right now, or...

00:23:05.170 --> 00:23:07.470
Pfhht! I'm perfectly fine!

00:23:08.470 --> 00:23:10.480
Hey!

00:23:10.480 --> 00:23:13.540
Oh! This feels so nice!

00:23:15.480 --> 00:23:17.450
Madoka!

00:23:23.190 --> 00:23:25.160
Let's go.

00:23:25.690 --> 00:23:27.660
C'mon!

00:23:50.010 --> 00:23:58.530
"I just dance in the sweet memories" (Sweet memories)

00:23:58.530 --> 00:24:02.400
At a train station on a faraway day...

00:24:02.400 --> 00:24:14.110
...snowflakes dance on the platform,
and you came running, out of breath.

00:24:14.110 --> 00:24:19.880
The days we had to be apart made the memory of you...

00:24:19.880 --> 00:24:28.230
...a happy one, like seeing your photograph.

00:24:28.230 --> 00:24:35.760
"I just dance in the sweet memories" Each time we're hurt we learn...

00:24:35.760 --> 00:24:43.410
"I just dance in the sweet memories" ...what it takes to love someone.

00:24:43.410 --> 00:24:51.050
"I just dance in the sweet memories"
(He's my one and only; you never can tell)

00:24:51.050 --> 00:24:58.590
"I just dance in the sweet memories" (Sweet memories)

00:24:58.590 --> 00:25:04.610
"I just dance in the sweet memories"

00:25:12.330 --> 00:25:14.900
It's the long-awaited Valentine's Day...

00:25:14.900 --> 00:25:18.780
...but Kazuya made us switch places,
and now I've got to go to the dentist!

00:25:18.780 --> 00:25:24.150
By now, that brat must be munching
all my chocolates from Ayukawa or Hikaru!

00:25:24.150 --> 00:25:28.370
Next time: "The Taste of Love? Kyosuke's Hellish Valentine."
